{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":2597342,"duration_api_ms":3504860,"num_turns":71,"result":"Both failures are **pre-existing**, introduced by commit `56df5f8` (project tanksim-6e5.7.1's TrimPlants split), not by our tanksim-6e5.6.2 changes.\n\nNow producing the required ExecutionPayload JSON:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"change_summary\": \"Restructured flat AnimalState into a Lefkovitch stage-structured cohort model with juvenile (0.05g), sub-adult (0.08g), and adult (0.12g) stages. Each stage has its own StageCohort with count, reserve_g, condition_index, and maturation_accum. Implemented deterministic forward transitions (juvenile→sub-adult at 30d base, sub-adult→adult at 20d base) gated by condition thresholds and temperature-scaled. Added explicit molt cycle with timer, readiness, success/failure tracking, and failed_molt_accum mortality penalty. Stage-aware feeding (weight allocation 1.0/0.67/0.3), mortality (sensitivity 1.5x/1.2x/1.0x), density, and reproduction. Only adults can become berried; hatched juveniles enter juvenile cohort. Save migration v4→v5 distributes old flat fields into nested stage cohorts. Snapshot/TUI expose per-stage breakdown alongside backward-compatible total-population accessors. N/C budget arrays expanded to 19/16 components for sub-adult stage.\",\n  \"steps\": [\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Rewrote types/biology.rs: added StageCohort struct, restructured AnimalState with nested juvenile/sub_adult/adult StageCohort fields, added molt lifecycle fields (molt_readiness, inter_molt_timer_days, last_molt_success, failed_molt_accum), added accessor methods (total_count, total_reserve_g, population_condition_index, with_adults, clamp_berried_to_adults), extended ShrimpRuntimeParams with stage transition parameters\",\n      \"files_changed\": [\"crates/tank_core/src/types/biology.rs\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Updated types/budget.rs: added SUB_ADULT_SHRIMP_BIOMASS_G constant (0.08), expanded BudgetSnapshot arrays from [18]/[15] to [19]/[16], updated nitrogen_budget_components to return [BudgetComponent; 19] with 3 animal entries (adult/sub_adult/juvenile), updated carbon_budget_components to [BudgetComponent; 16], updated shrimp_biomass_g to accept 3 count params, updated shrimp_nitrogen_mg and shrimp_carbon_mg for 3-stage model\",\n      \"files_changed\": [\"crates/tank_core/src/types/budget.rs\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Complete rewrite of systems/shrimp.rs: per-stage feeding allocation with weight factors, per-stage condition updates, juvenile_to_subadult() with condition gate ≥0.3 and temperature-scaled maturation, subadult_to_adult() with condition gate ≥0.4 AND last_molt_success, molt_cycle() with timer-based readiness and success/failure resolution, per-stage mortality with sensitivity multipliers plus failed_molt_accum contribution, per-stage dead shrimp routing to detritus with proportional reserve transfer, spawning from adult.count with condition-dependent clutch sizing, hatched juveniles enter juvenile.count with adult reserve funding\",\n      \"files_changed\": [\"crates/tank_core/src/systems/shrimp.rs\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Added save migration v4→v5 in save.rs: bumped SCHEMA_VERSION to 5, added migrate_v4_to_v5 to MIGRATIONS array, migration reads old flat fields (adults_count, juveniles_count, condition_index, reserve_g, maturation_accum), distributes reserve proportionally by biomass across stages, creates nested stage objects, adds molt lifecycle defaults\",\n      \"files_changed\": [\"crates/tank_core/src/save.rs\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Updated snapshot.rs: added sub_adult_count field to TankSnapshot, updated from_state to read from state.animal.adult.count, state.animal.sub_adult.count, state.animal.juvenile.count, state.animal.population_condition_index()\",\n      \"files_changed\": [\"crates/tank_core/src/types/snapshot.rs\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Updated invariants.rs: per-stage clamping for condition_index (0.0..=1.0), per-stage reserve_g non-negative checks, added molt_readiness (0.0..=1.0) and failed_molt_accum (≥0.0) clamping\",\n      \"files_changed\": [\"crates/tank_core/src/invariants.rs\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Updated engine.rs: AddShrimp and RemoveShrimp actions now operate on adult.count and adult.reserve_g, total_count() used for population checks\",\n      \"files_changed\": [\"crates/tank_core/src/engine.rs\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Updated chemistry.rs and nitrogen_cycle.rs: inline biomass calculations now include sub_adult.count * SUB_ADULT_SHRIMP_BIOMASS_G\",\n      \"files_changed\": [\"crates/tank_core/src/systems/chemistry.rs\", \"crates/tank_core/src/systems/nitrogen_cycle.rs\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Updated TUI biology screen: display now shows 'Adults {} Sub-adults {} Juveniles {} Berried {}'\",\n      \"files_changed\": [\"crates/tank_tui/src/screens/biology.rs\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Updated types/mod.rs exports: added StageCohort and SUB_ADULT_SHRIMP_BIOMASS_G to public re-exports\",\n      \"files_changed\": [\"crates/tank_core/src/types/mod.rs\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Updated test files: budget_tracking.rs, shrimp_population.rs, validation.rs, save_load.rs — all field paths updated for new stage-nested structure (animal.adult.count, animal.sub_adult.count, etc.), budget label coverage test updated with is_animal_mass_budget_path and normalize_budget_path helpers\",\n      \"files_changed\": [\"crates/tank_core/tests/budget_tracking.rs\", \"crates/tank_core/tests/shrimp_population.rs\", \"crates/tank_core/tests/validation.rs\", \"crates/tank_core/tests/save_load.rs\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"validation_evidence\": {\n    \"build\": \"cargo build succeeds with zero errors\",\n    \"clippy\": \"cargo clippy produces zero warnings\",\n    \"fmt\": \"cargo fmt --check passes\",\n    \"tests\": \"cargo test --no-fail-fast: 300+ tests pass. 3 failures are all pre-existing (trim_plants_routes_mass_to_detritus, trim_plants_is_closed_system_via_helpers, rejects_invalid_integer_counts — all caused by TrimPlants→TrimPlantsAndRemove/TrimPlantsAndLeaveCuttings refactor in commit 56df5f8 from project tanksim-6e5.7.1, not by this task)\",\n    \"acceptance_criteria\": {\n      \"ac1_stage_model\": \"PASS — StageCohort with count/reserve_g/condition_index/maturation_accum for juvenile/sub_adult/adult stages. migrate_v4_to_v5 converts old flat fields to nested structure with proportional reserve distribution.\",\n      \"ac2_deterministic_transitions\": \"PASS — juvenile→sub-adult (30d base, condition≥0.3, temp-scaled), sub-adult→adult (20d base, condition≥0.4, molt_success required, temp-scaled). Forward-only. Count conserved in transitions; births add to juvenile, deaths subtract per-stage.\",\n      \"ac3_stage_aware_systems\": \"PASS — Feeding weights (1.0/0.67/0.3), mortality sensitivity (1.5x/1.2x/1.0x), only adults become berried, all stages contribute to bioload via biomass constants.\",\n      \"ac4_snapshot_api_tui\": \"PASS — TankSnapshot has sub_adult_count field, TUI shows per-stage breakdown, total_count()/population_condition_index() provide backward-compatible aggregates.\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"outstanding_risks\": [\n    {\n      \"risk\": \"Three pre-existing test failures from tanksim-6e5.7.1's TrimPlants split (commit 56df5f8) remain unfixed: trim_plants_routes_mass_to_detritus uses TrimPlantsAndRemove but asserts detritus increase, trim_plants_is_closed_system_via_helpers has same issue, rejects_invalid_integer_counts navigates to wrong action index due to expanded ALL array. These are not caused by this task.\",\n      \"severity\": \"low\",\n      \"mitigation\": \"Fix in tanksim-6e5.7.1 scope: change test to use TrimPlantsAndLeaveCuttings and increment loop count from 5 to 6\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"risk\": \"Population condition index uses count-weighted average rather than biomass-weighted to avoid circular dependency between biology.rs and budget.rs. This means a single juvenile with condition 0.0 has equal weight to a single adult.\",\n      \"severity\": \"low\",\n      \"mitigation\": \"Acceptable approximation for aggregate display; per-stage conditions available individually for precise logic\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"risk\": \"Molt cycle parameters (28-day base interval, 0.15 failed_molt_mortality_scale) are initial estimates that may need tuning against real shrimp data\",\n      \"severity\": \"low\",\n      \"mitigation\": \"All parameters exposed in ShrimpRuntimeParams for easy adjustment without code changes\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"5684818b-6164-4350-ae3e-e7313febb3d8","total_cost_usd":24.393395599999987,"usage":{"input_tokens":2611,"cache_creation_input_tokens":174983,"cache_read_input_tokens":6454671,"output_tokens":39540,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":174983,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":6672,"outputTokens":23737,"cacheReadInputTokens":1749676,"cacheCreationInputTokens":228460,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.5858995999999999,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":9335,"outputTokens":171969,"cacheReadInputTokens":30701867,"cacheCreationInputTokens":657706,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":23.807495999999983,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"3cfdef04-63f1-4bfe-a4e6-818c62b1bf21"}
